{"id":"en_back-to-1994-for-mom","title":"Back to 1994 for Mom","titleEn":"Back to 1994 for Mom","description":"Wang Gangan carries the guilt of having indirectly caused the death of her mother, He Chunhua. Consumed by regret, she finds herself transported back to 1994, where she takes on the role of a home tutor in order to stay close to her mother. Through this arrangement, she encourages He Chunhua to pursue the dreams she had once abandoned. As the two spend time together, Wang Gangan comes to understand the full depth of the love her mother had always held for her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/back-to-1994-for-mom/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/back-to-1994-for-mom/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Rags to Riches","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devbm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_back-to-1994-for-mom_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devbm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_back-to-1994-for-mom_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devbm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_back-to-1994-for-mom_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devbm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_back-to-1994-for-mom_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7devbm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_back-to-1994-for-mom_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1